        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of owning and managing your very own pixelated grocery store. Build your store from a small shop to a giant super market, filled with produce, frozen goods, and meats n sweets.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character with a unique look using outfits and headgear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/ab83d335b9a0e28daf358eb4b4a04a8e.avif?t=1765234506\" width=203 height=124 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and manage products, including dry, cold, frozen, and produce goods.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock items onto shelves for customers to shop for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/e962bc3def496763b8a30e8ee89c876c.avif?t=1765234506\" width=158 height=165 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete orders via a mini-game to earn cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/fc0dea50a59978ccefce6405986c582f.avif?t=1765234506\" width=161 height=212 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for messy customers leaving trash in the store and tidy things up when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/5c63fbdfa892dbfd97e537338d41bf85.avif?t=1765234506\" width=119 height=130 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your store with various wall and floor types to look unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your store safe from shoplifters by spanking them with a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/c473fa8543bb0a8e0d760e91d3f2d4bf.avif?t=1765234506\" width=179 height=134 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire lackeys to do your dirty work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt pets to keep around your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/be517a14ee1f882ea1184a66bd6c0a77.avif?t=1765234506\" width=142 height=180 /></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of owning and managing your very own pixelated grocery store. Build your store from a small shop to a giant super market, filled with produce, frozen goods, and meats n sweets.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character with a unique look using outfits and headgear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/ab83d335b9a0e28daf358eb4b4a04a8e.avif?t=1765234506\" width=203 height=124 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and manage products, including dry, cold, frozen, and produce goods.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock items onto shelves for customers to shop for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/e962bc3def496763b8a30e8ee89c876c.avif?t=1765234506\" width=158 height=165 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete orders via a mini-game to earn cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/fc0dea50a59978ccefce6405986c582f.avif?t=1765234506\" width=161 height=212 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for messy customers leaving trash in the store and tidy things up when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/5c63fbdfa892dbfd97e537338d41bf85.avif?t=1765234506\" width=119 height=130 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your store with various wall and floor types to look unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your store safe from shoplifters by spanking them with a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/c473fa8543bb0a8e0d760e91d3f2d4bf.avif?t=1765234506\" width=179 height=134 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire lackeys to do your dirty work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt pets to keep around your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133370/extras/be517a14ee1f882ea1184a66bd6c0a77.avif?t=1765234506\" width=142 height=180 /></span></p></li></ul>",
